            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.69

- Swiping the artwork to change track now answers with a small tap, in both the desktop overlay and full screen. Going forward and going back feel different, matching the taps the previous and next buttons already give, so a skip is confirmed under your finger the moment it takes.
]]></description>
